      "beat_id": "NB02",
      "act": "1 stakes",
      "narration_text": "Without help, understanding your numbers looks like a loop: export a CSV, open it, stare at rows and columns, get a vague sense things are up or down, close the file. So the questions that actually matter go unanswered — not because they're unanswerable, but because answering felt too hard. Decisions ride on gut feel instead.",
